<title>UK: London Insurance Market appoints fin chief.</title>
<headline>London Insurance Market appoints fin chief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Insurance Market Investment Trust Plc (LIMIT) appointed Tony Keys as finance director effective January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Keys will take over the financial responsibilities carried out until now by managing director Michael Carpenter, as LIMIT's portfolio of operations has expanded, the company said.</p>
<p>It has bought Janson Green managing agency and plans to buy Bankside managing agency and plans further opportunities for development.</p>
<p>Keys has been a non-executive director of LIMIT since flotation in November 1993.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
